Appropriately supervise the conduct of the collective investments schemes (CIS) managers and monitor their compliance with the provisions of the Collective Investments Schemes Control Act, 2002 and related legislation within the framework of the objectives of the department. The person appointed in this position will report to the Manager: Investment Providers.
